                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">ceca4a92-8127-40aa-968d-fcbd9c09e6d4</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">05 nodi vincoli molle masse temperatura</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Attributi in sequenza sullo stesso nodo: cedimento imposto, molle, masse, temperatura e forza.
Build riceve solo l'ultima copia: collegare copie intermedie sommerebbe nuovamente i contributi. Le rotazioni sono in radianti.
Unita': m, kN, kPa, tonne, C. Leggere gli input e i pannelli; valori dimostrativi modificabili.</item>
